WEBVTT

01:49.530 --> 01:54.930
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.930
[Episode 35]

02:25.750 --> 02:26.680
Big! Big!

02:26.680 --> 02:27.560
Small! Small!

02:29.980 --> 02:30.880
Impressive.

02:49.770 --> 02:52.850
[Grace & Elegance]

02:52.710 --> 02:54.030
I didn't expect there to be such a place

02:54.030 --> 02:55.310
in the script world.

02:56.280 --> 02:58.150
The people and stories I didn't even write

02:58.150 --> 02:59.280
are so interesting,

02:59.910 --> 03:01.750
even better than the ones I did write.

03:01.750 --> 03:03.480
No offense, Mr. Screenwriter,

03:04.000 --> 03:06.460
but what you wrote
really wasn't that great.

03:07.080 --> 03:09.870
Look at the stories we actors
came up with ourselves.

03:09.870 --> 03:11.840
They're way better than yours,
don't you think?

03:11.840 --> 03:12.630
Tell me,

03:12.910 --> 03:14.680
why did you bring me here?

03:17.910 --> 03:19.840
I wanted you to understand what it means

03:19.840 --> 03:21.560
to respect the characters.

03:23.060 --> 03:24.460
Respect the characters?

03:26.680 --> 03:27.470
I know,

03:27.630 --> 03:29.190
to you, Nan Heng is just

03:29.400 --> 03:30.750
a fictional character.

03:30.840 --> 03:35.340
[Grace & Elegance]

03:31.470 --> 03:33.400
The passersby on the street,

03:33.800 --> 03:35.630
and the brothers
from Waning River Crescent—

03:35.630 --> 03:37.590
they're all nobodies to you,

03:37.630 --> 03:38.430
right?

03:40.120 --> 03:41.190
But in my eyes,

03:41.190 --> 03:43.190
they're living, breathing people.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.160
Every day of their lives is real,

03:45.630 --> 03:48.630
and every day,
they all just want to live in the moment.

03:48.630 --> 03:49.430
So,

03:49.840 --> 03:51.800
I hope you'll show some mercy

03:51.910 --> 03:53.000
and let each of them

03:53.190 --> 03:55.150
live the life they want.

03:55.630 --> 03:56.280
Okay?

03:56.590 --> 03:57.520
Song Xiaoyu,

03:58.470 --> 03:59.470
you're really determined

03:59.470 --> 04:01.150
not to come back with me, huh?

04:01.280 --> 04:01.960
Yes.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.520
If you try to force the story

04:04.520 --> 04:05.870
back on the so-called track,

04:05.870 --> 04:07.680
a lot of people will die.

04:08.110 --> 04:09.120
Nan Heng and I

04:09.750 --> 04:11.560
won't just stand by.

04:19.720 --> 04:20.779
Mr. Screenwriter,

04:21.390 --> 04:22.420
You're not

04:22.720 --> 04:24.600
planning something shady again, are you?

04:24.600 --> 04:25.390
Me?

04:28.270 --> 04:30.350
What shady plan could I possibly have?

04:30.350 --> 04:31.600
I'm just thinking

04:32.190 --> 04:34.270
how I can better adapt to this world.

04:37.430 --> 04:38.420
Shangguan He!

04:38.560 --> 04:39.600
Come out!

04:40.270 --> 04:40.870
Oh no.

04:40.870 --> 04:42.070
Mrs. Song is here.

04:45.730 --> 04:48.070
You betrayed me first,
so don't blame me for betraying you.

04:48.070 --> 04:49.159
You must be out of your mind

04:49.159 --> 04:51.760
to treat fictional characters
as real people.

04:53.420 --> 04:58.700
[Celestial Realm]

04:56.120 --> 04:56.920
Shangguan He!

04:57.380 --> 04:58.670
You scoundrel!

04:59.000 --> 05:00.680
What on earth did you do

05:00.680 --> 05:01.720
to ruin my daughter's marriage

05:01.720 --> 05:03.180
to the Eighteenth Prince?

05:03.560 --> 05:04.490
I'm telling you,

05:04.950 --> 05:06.390
if you have even a shred of conscience,

05:06.390 --> 05:07.920
come with me to Song Residence

05:07.920 --> 05:09.770
and personally tell Yiting

05:09.800 --> 05:11.390
to give up on you completely

05:11.510 --> 05:13.770
and marry into the royal family in peace.

05:15.890 --> 05:19.760
[Celestial Realm]

05:16.430 --> 05:18.070
Madam, I understand what you're saying.

05:18.070 --> 05:20.000
But if you're asking me to hand
Yiting over to someone else,

05:20.000 --> 05:21.460
I'm afraid I can't do that.

05:21.680 --> 05:22.480
What?

05:23.120 --> 05:25.160
How dare you say that to me?

05:26.120 --> 05:28.070
Don't tell me you want to marry Yiting?

05:28.070 --> 05:29.510
If she's willing to marry me,

05:29.510 --> 05:30.630
then I'm willing to marry her.

05:30.630 --> 05:31.960
So they love each other.

05:31.970 --> 05:33.870
And what makes you think
you're worthy of my daughter?

05:33.870 --> 05:34.680
You are right.

05:34.720 --> 05:36.980
That's what I thought just a few days ago.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.840
Song Yiting is truly

05:39.040 --> 05:40.270
the most elegant,

05:40.270 --> 05:41.870
proud, and noble woman girl.

05:41.950 --> 05:44.390
A man like me,
a nobody from the martial arts world—

05:44.390 --> 05:46.000
how could I ever be good enough for her?

05:46.000 --> 05:46.630
And how could I ever

05:46.630 --> 05:48.120
give her the life she wants?

05:48.120 --> 05:49.580
Good that you understand!

05:49.800 --> 05:51.659
But later, I realized I was wrong.

05:52.159 --> 05:54.800
Because what Song Yiting wants
isn't a marriage,

05:54.800 --> 05:57.260
nor a match
that just looks perfect on paper.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.950
She wants someone
who can roam the world with her

05:59.950 --> 06:01.830
and live a life of freedom and joy.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.000
Mrs. Song,

06:04.510 --> 06:05.440
I'll say all this

06:05.720 --> 06:07.310
to her myself.

06:08.190 --> 06:10.430
If she wants a life free of constraints,

06:10.510 --> 06:12.000
I'll gladly go with her.

06:12.310 --> 06:14.800
If she wants to experience
the joys of marriage,

06:14.800 --> 06:17.460
I'll marry her with proper rites
and tradition.

06:18.190 --> 06:19.000
Or perhaps,

06:20.510 --> 06:22.040
I can marry into her family.

06:23.800 --> 06:25.330
You're absolutely insane!

06:25.390 --> 06:25.790
You...

06:25.800 --> 06:27.000
Mr. Screenwriter,

06:27.270 --> 06:29.160
how much heartbreak

06:29.160 --> 06:31.190
have you been through in real life

06:31.190 --> 06:32.390
to come up with
a character like Mrs. Song,

06:32.390 --> 06:34.240
someone who likes to break couples up?

06:34.240 --> 06:35.430
If you had just been merciful

06:35.430 --> 06:36.950
and let Song Yiting marry Nan Heng,

06:36.950 --> 06:39.480
wouldn't this whole drama
have been avoided?

06:43.830 --> 06:45.630
What's wrong with His Highness?

06:46.240 --> 06:47.040
Strange.

06:47.430 --> 06:48.870
It's truly weird.

06:49.630 --> 06:51.430
Your energy and blood are both depleted.

06:51.430 --> 06:54.159
Your Highness,
this looks like a serious injury.

06:55.000 --> 06:55.980
Could it be...

06:56.120 --> 06:57.680
that the wound
he suffered on his wedding day

06:57.680 --> 06:58.880
still hasn't healed?

06:59.070 --> 07:00.200
No, that can't be it.

07:01.070 --> 07:03.040
Even during the worst days of his injury,

07:03.040 --> 07:04.630
his body wasn't this weak.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.480
So why has it only gotten worse

07:06.480 --> 07:08.270
over time?

07:09.190 --> 07:10.190
It feels more like

07:10.600 --> 07:12.210
that injury

07:12.360 --> 07:14.560
triggered some deeper illness.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.650
Is there any way to treat it?

07:18.080 --> 07:19.360
I can only

07:19.510 --> 07:21.000
try some tonics

07:21.380 --> 07:23.040
to replenish your energy and blood,

07:23.040 --> 07:24.500
and observe how things go.

07:30.000 --> 07:30.870
Your Grace?

07:32.110 --> 07:33.990
What are you doing here?

07:34.480 --> 07:35.950
I just returned to the capital.

07:35.950 --> 07:38.680
I shouldn't be interfering
in your family affairs.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.950
Then please don't.

07:41.950 --> 07:43.190
Madam, what you said

07:43.480 --> 07:45.140
is rather unpleasant to hear.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.390
Unpleasant or not,

07:47.390 --> 07:49.680
this is still the Song family's business,

07:49.680 --> 07:51.720
not something for outsiders to meddle in.

07:51.720 --> 07:53.720
That may have been true before,

07:53.720 --> 07:54.510
but now

07:55.190 --> 07:57.450
it's also the business of the Chu family.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.650
Don't you want a son-in-law

08:01.720 --> 08:03.360
who's a good match in status?

08:03.950 --> 08:04.750
Then today,

08:05.120 --> 08:07.870
I'll officially adopt
Shangguan He as my son

08:07.870 --> 08:10.530
and give him the status
of a prince's household.

08:12.270 --> 08:13.120
Adopted son?

08:13.830 --> 08:15.120
That's great.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.560
My father and the old lord

08:17.560 --> 08:18.760
were sworn brothers.

08:19.560 --> 08:22.950
And now Yiting and Chu He are in love—

08:23.120 --> 08:24.650
what could be more perfect?

08:25.950 --> 08:26.680
Madam,

08:26.680 --> 08:27.560
if Father knows about it,

08:27.560 --> 08:28.630
he'll be thrilled.

08:28.630 --> 08:29.310
Wait.

08:29.310 --> 08:31.440
You're already calling him Chu He now?

08:31.800 --> 08:34.730
Our Second Master sure gave up
a lot just to get a wife.

08:34.789 --> 08:36.200
He's a real man.

08:36.200 --> 08:38.460
Family name is just a superficial thing.

08:39.549 --> 08:40.360
Mrs. Song,

08:40.720 --> 08:42.270
didn't you keep saying he was just

08:42.270 --> 08:44.330
a nobody from the martial arts world?

08:44.390 --> 08:45.870
Are you satisfied now?

08:46.630 --> 08:47.670
I... I...

08:48.000 --> 08:48.790
I...

08:49.480 --> 08:50.670
What are you waiting for?

08:50.670 --> 08:52.120
Hurry up and call him Father.

08:52.120 --> 08:52.960
Well...

08:52.960 --> 08:53.630
It's...

08:53.630 --> 08:55.600
In the blink of an eye,
I suddenly have a father.

08:55.600 --> 08:57.060
Isn't this all too sudden?

08:57.480 --> 08:58.440
Don't hesitate.

08:59.360 --> 09:00.120
Shanhu,

09:00.120 --> 09:01.250
get paper and brush.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.200
There's no better time than the present.

09:03.200 --> 09:07.660
Today, let's sign the marriage contract
between the Song family and Chu family.

09:08.840 --> 09:11.030
He finally did something good.

09:14.030 --> 09:16.890
Father, what exactly
was your intention with this?

09:19.960 --> 09:22.090
Naturally, it's to deal with Nan Heng.

09:22.270 --> 09:23.330
Deal with Nan Heng?

09:24.510 --> 09:26.910
What does this marriage
have to do with him?

09:30.630 --> 09:31.440
Could it be...

09:32.470 --> 09:34.270
that you want to bring Shangguan He
and the Song family

09:34.270 --> 09:35.270
into our camp

09:35.480 --> 09:37.810
to drive a wedge
between them and Nan Heng?

09:38.090 --> 09:39.880
From your character's point of view,

09:39.880 --> 09:41.440
whatever you think is right.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.510
I had my reasons

09:42.510 --> 09:43.790
for doing this.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.600
Nan Heng should be

09:48.240 --> 09:50.750
close to death from his illness by now.

09:53.420 --> 09:55.530
[Your Majesty, I am willing to take Shangguan as my adopted son
and personally teach him to serve the country. I humbly ask for your gracious consent.]

09:57.600 --> 09:59.670
He used to be Shangguan Baihe,

10:00.240 --> 10:01.600
then Shangguan He.

10:01.840 --> 10:02.770
Now, look at him.

10:02.790 --> 10:04.360
He's lost even the Shangguan surname.

10:04.360 --> 10:05.360
I must say, He,

10:05.670 --> 10:07.070
you're really generous.

10:08.440 --> 10:09.320
Shut up.

10:11.150 --> 10:12.600
Lord Qianyu came at a strange time

10:12.600 --> 10:13.730
and acts strangely.

10:13.870 --> 10:15.480
Though he seems to strike blindly,

10:15.480 --> 10:16.210
I suspect...

10:16.670 --> 10:18.030
there's more to this.

10:19.840 --> 10:20.630
Fugui.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.380
Dismiss everyone.

10:25.160 --> 10:27.490
There's nobody else here, Your Highness.

10:33.330 --> 10:36.930
[Lofty Aspirations]

10:37.440 --> 10:38.630
What's so secret

10:38.630 --> 10:40.160
that even Fugui can't hear?

10:41.120 --> 10:42.360
Have you ever heard of

10:43.610 --> 10:44.830
the script world?

10:56.100 --> 11:00.570
[As per custom, we respectfully ask for your daughter's name
and seek your approval for the marriage. Chu Li.]

11:07.870 --> 11:08.800
Come on, Father,

11:09.480 --> 11:11.200
I've already taken care of it.

11:11.320 --> 11:13.120
why do you still look so worried?

11:14.720 --> 11:15.550
Yimeng,

11:16.910 --> 11:18.270
why did Chu Li

11:18.390 --> 11:21.080
help Shangguan He and Yiting?

11:22.670 --> 11:25.730
He certainly wanted
to prove that, in this world, he...

11:29.030 --> 11:32.470
He wanted to solve
your biggest problem, of course.

11:35.480 --> 11:36.030
Father,

11:36.510 --> 11:39.720
you actually quite like Shangguan He,

11:39.720 --> 11:40.390
don't you?

11:41.080 --> 11:45.150
And you don't want Yiting
to marry into the royal family,

11:47.550 --> 11:48.360
right?

11:51.970 --> 11:54.240
Nothing escapes your sharp eyes.

11:54.630 --> 11:55.600
See?

11:56.360 --> 11:58.150
The family's long-lasting conflict

11:58.150 --> 12:00.030
is finally coming to an end.

12:00.230 --> 12:02.700
Let me enjoy some peace and quiet now.

12:03.030 --> 12:04.140
Song Yude!

12:04.410 --> 12:05.820
I've been looking all over for you!

12:05.820 --> 12:06.630
Come, come.

12:08.950 --> 12:09.830
Honey.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.840
The marriage contract is already signed.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.120
Please stop causing trouble.

12:14.120 --> 12:14.910
Wait.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.600
I'm not the one causing trouble.

12:16.600 --> 12:18.360
Get your facts straight.

12:18.510 --> 12:20.790
It's your precious daughter
who is causing trouble.

12:20.790 --> 12:22.000
She says she won't marry him.

12:22.000 --> 12:22.910
She says

12:22.910 --> 12:25.150
she won't marry Chu He until she hears him

12:25.150 --> 12:27.960
confess his feelings to her in person.

12:29.080 --> 12:30.880
You're really driving me crazy!

12:35.670 --> 12:36.600
Wait a moment.

12:37.000 --> 12:38.150
Let me process this.

12:39.910 --> 12:41.720
Are you saying
this storybook created its own world

12:41.720 --> 12:43.450
and we are all characters in it?

12:44.510 --> 12:46.080
When I first heard this,

12:46.510 --> 12:48.170
I had the same reaction as you.

12:48.790 --> 12:49.600
This...

12:49.600 --> 12:51.530
This is absolutely preposterous.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.120
I understand

13:02.910 --> 13:03.720
it's hard

13:05.000 --> 13:06.200
to accept now.

13:06.480 --> 13:07.320
No, no, no.

13:08.550 --> 13:10.880
I've long thought something was strange.

13:11.000 --> 13:11.840
How could

13:13.080 --> 13:14.390
such an

13:14.390 --> 13:16.990
incredibly handsome face exist
in this world?

13:17.910 --> 13:20.120
So you are from a storybook?

13:20.530 --> 13:22.640
That explains everything.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.080
Tell me,

13:24.120 --> 13:25.360
what kind of ending

13:25.480 --> 13:27.010
could someone like me have?

13:27.120 --> 13:29.120
I'm sure I'm more popular with the readers

13:29.120 --> 13:30.850
than you, a cold-faced prince.

13:31.080 --> 13:31.870
You

13:32.790 --> 13:33.990
don't have an ending.

13:35.270 --> 13:41.010
[One with Light and Dust]

13:37.000 --> 13:37.870
Which means

13:37.870 --> 13:39.270
Shangguan He wasn't even

13:39.390 --> 13:41.120
in the original script.

13:41.350 --> 13:42.110
What?

13:42.670 --> 13:43.870
How is that possible?

13:44.120 --> 13:46.050
Then how did I come into existence?

13:46.150 --> 13:46.960
I think

13:47.510 --> 13:49.390
you must be a character born

13:49.390 --> 13:51.150
from the workings of this script world,

13:51.150 --> 13:52.440
someone who appeared out of nowhere

13:52.440 --> 13:54.300
and could vanish just as quickly.

13:55.560 --> 13:56.720
Someone who appeared out of nowhere

13:56.720 --> 13:58.580
and could vanish just as quickly.

13:59.460 --> 14:00.030
Yes.

14:00.910 --> 14:02.720
I believe the identity of Li Shiliu

14:02.720 --> 14:03.910
came about because of

14:03.910 --> 14:05.550
the unpredictable changes

14:05.570 --> 14:07.200
during the script's progression.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.360
The changes became too overwhelming

14:08.360 --> 14:09.510
to control,

14:09.810 --> 14:13.270
so the screenwriter took the form
of Lord Qianyu and came here.

14:16.140 --> 14:17.260
Then tell me,

14:18.020 --> 14:19.150
does this storybook

14:19.490 --> 14:20.840
include Song Yiting?

14:22.200 --> 14:22.840
Yes.

14:23.600 --> 14:25.080
Who did she end up marrying?

14:25.080 --> 14:26.410
The Eighteenth Prince?

14:32.110 --> 14:33.420
She married me.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.360
You?

14:34.480 --> 14:35.270
Don't worry.

14:35.270 --> 14:36.910
I have absolutely
no interest in Song Yiting.

14:36.910 --> 14:37.910
I'm telling you this

14:37.910 --> 14:39.240
because I think there's something fishy

14:39.240 --> 14:40.570
about this Lord Qianyu.

14:45.120 --> 14:46.200
But it's strange.

14:46.510 --> 14:47.720
According to the storybook,

14:47.720 --> 14:48.670
he should be trying hard to match you

14:48.670 --> 14:50.030
with Song Yiting.

14:50.240 --> 14:52.910
So why did he end up arranging
for her to marry me instead?

14:52.910 --> 14:54.240
The one controlling the game

14:54.240 --> 14:56.750
only needs to move
a single piece to change everything.

14:56.750 --> 14:57.550
So,

14:57.630 --> 14:58.910
we need to figure out

14:58.910 --> 15:00.720
his next move quickly.

15:01.480 --> 15:02.480
Know yourself and know your enemy,

15:02.480 --> 15:04.140
and you'll never be defeated.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.030
But…

15:05.600 --> 15:06.790
you're not saying

15:07.440 --> 15:09.640
I should do the investigation, are you?

15:10.120 --> 15:11.360
You've been around Song Yiting
so long that

15:11.360 --> 15:13.480
you've even learned
to jump in and answer questions.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.550
And now,

15:14.630 --> 15:16.070
you're Lord Qianyu's adopted son.

15:16.070 --> 15:16.910
That makes you

15:16.910 --> 15:18.080
the perfect person to look into this.

15:18.080 --> 15:19.840
We're all just fictional characters,

15:19.840 --> 15:20.910
so why do some

15:20.910 --> 15:22.510
get to act all high and mighty,

15:22.510 --> 15:23.960
while others

15:23.960 --> 15:26.020
don't even get a chance to fight back?

15:27.600 --> 15:28.930
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.480
I'm the male lead.

15:33.340 --> 15:34.970
What the hell is a male lead?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.080
So your fate is completely

15:36.080 --> 15:38.120
controlled by the writer, isn't it?

15:38.120 --> 15:39.170
Is that interesting?

15:39.110 --> 15:43.550
[Lofty Aspirations]

15:39.630 --> 15:41.030
I appeared out of nowhere

15:41.030 --> 15:42.440
and could vanish just as quickly.

15:42.440 --> 15:44.240
My life is far more interesting.

15:47.120 --> 15:47.750
Wait.

15:49.550 --> 15:50.810
Doesn't that just mean

15:51.320 --> 15:52.510
I came from nothing

15:52.750 --> 15:54.680
and could vanish into nothing too?

15:57.200 --> 15:58.550
Am I going to disappear?

17:39.450 --> 17:40.400
Honey!

17:42.270 --> 17:43.070
Honey!

17:44.660 --> 17:45.890
Honey!

17:50.480 --> 17:52.240
No!

17:55.880 --> 17:57.880
Someone who appeared out of nowhere

17:58.140 --> 18:00.000
and could vanish just as quickly?

18:13.070 --> 18:13.880
Yiting,

18:15.110 --> 18:16.440
you have to understand,

18:16.640 --> 18:19.240
people have different personalities.

18:19.480 --> 18:20.790
Shangguan He

18:20.960 --> 18:21.960
has always been carefree.

18:21.960 --> 18:24.270
It's normal that he doesn't know
how to express his feelings.

18:24.270 --> 18:26.880
But everything he said
at Waning River Crescent today

18:26.880 --> 18:29.110
must have come from
the bottom of his heart.

18:29.110 --> 18:30.400
He didn't say a word about love,

18:30.400 --> 18:31.640
but every word showed that

18:31.640 --> 18:32.790
he cares about you,

18:32.790 --> 18:33.680
likes you,

18:33.680 --> 18:35.010
and wants to be with you.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.750
A confession

18:36.960 --> 18:39.240
is just one way to express one's feelings.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.840
Is it really that important?

18:41.960 --> 18:43.220
You don't understand.

18:44.960 --> 18:47.030
I've made my feelings clear
to him for so long,

18:47.030 --> 18:49.110
but he has never once
said anything in return.

18:49.110 --> 18:50.240
I don't understand?

18:50.510 --> 18:52.440
Me, a married woman with experience,

18:52.440 --> 18:53.570
I don't understand?

18:54.960 --> 18:56.750
You just lie there doing nothing.

18:56.750 --> 18:57.590
That's how you are in life,

18:57.590 --> 18:58.590
and in love.

18:59.200 --> 19:01.130
Between you and Nan Heng, he took 99

19:01.510 --> 19:03.160
out of 100 steps to get to you,

19:03.160 --> 19:04.790
dragging himself forward the whole way.

19:04.790 --> 19:05.590
Do you

19:05.640 --> 19:06.770
really understand?

19:36.680 --> 19:37.510
What's up?

19:38.830 --> 19:39.690
Your Highness,

19:40.030 --> 19:41.200
I heard everything

19:41.200 --> 19:42.530
you said to Shangguan He

19:42.750 --> 19:44.080
in the courtyard today.

19:47.590 --> 19:48.240
So...

19:48.720 --> 19:50.720
you know about the script world now?

19:51.200 --> 19:51.790
I do.

19:53.030 --> 19:54.360
And you've accepted it?

19:55.270 --> 19:56.130
Your Highness,

19:56.430 --> 19:57.510
you thought that,

19:57.540 --> 19:59.480
with my personality, I'd make a huge scene

19:59.480 --> 20:01.210
when I found out, didn't you?

20:02.070 --> 20:03.790
I was shocked at first.

20:03.950 --> 20:05.750
But after eating eight buns

20:05.750 --> 20:07.750
and running ten laps around
the Crown Prince's Residence,

20:07.750 --> 20:09.680
I suddenly understood everything.

20:09.680 --> 20:12.180
Have I ever seen
this so-called "real world"

20:12.350 --> 20:13.680
outside the storybook?

20:13.790 --> 20:14.910
I haven't.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.130
So it doesn't exist.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.680
And since it doesn't exist,

20:17.680 --> 20:19.110
why can't I treat this place

20:19.110 --> 20:20.640
as the real world?

20:23.200 --> 20:25.800
I didn't expect
you'd come to that conclusion.

20:26.070 --> 20:28.640
Well, I did grow up with you.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.270
Not like that Shangguan He—

20:30.270 --> 20:31.870
who knows where he came from.

20:35.110 --> 20:35.970
Your Highness,

20:36.680 --> 20:37.940
why didn't you tell him

20:38.160 --> 20:39.890
you've been coughing up blood?

20:46.590 --> 20:47.520
I didn't tell him

20:48.440 --> 20:50.370
because I didn't want him to worry.

20:50.890 --> 20:53.480
And you're keeping it
from the Crown Princess too?

20:53.480 --> 20:54.280
That's right.

20:54.560 --> 20:56.270
She absolutely cannot know.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.830
If Lord Qianyu is really that powerful,

20:58.830 --> 21:00.220
what will happen if you

20:59.920 --> 21:03.500
[Cultivate Virtue and Pursue Knowledge]

21:00.270 --> 21:02.000
go against him, Your Highness?

21:03.630 --> 21:04.560
I don't know yet.

21:06.030 --> 21:07.110
But no matter what,

21:08.070 --> 21:10.130
I must find a way to change the ending,

21:10.830 --> 21:12.720
because when we got married,

21:13.070 --> 21:15.160
I promised her
I would protect her for life.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.020
Your Highness,

21:16.050 --> 21:18.150
that's my wish as well.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.550
I may be slow,

21:20.030 --> 21:21.400
but I'm not stupid.

21:22.110 --> 21:23.310
If what you told Shangguan He

21:23.310 --> 21:24.510
wasn't dangerous,

21:24.510 --> 21:26.040
then why didn't you tell me?

21:26.270 --> 21:27.720
Isn't it because you were afraid

21:27.720 --> 21:29.830
I'd expose your health issues

21:29.830 --> 21:31.720
and mess up the plan against Lord Qianyu?

21:31.720 --> 21:32.920
I have my own plans.

21:34.140 --> 21:34.900
Yes!

21:35.240 --> 21:36.530
You always have your plans—

21:36.530 --> 21:38.070
when we were beyond the border,

21:38.070 --> 21:39.800
when we returned to the capital,

21:39.800 --> 21:41.190
when you were wronged,

21:41.210 --> 21:43.270
even when your life
was hanging by a thread.

21:43.270 --> 21:44.130
Your Highness,

21:44.240 --> 21:45.710
let me ask you one thing:

21:45.920 --> 21:47.070
in your plans,

21:47.070 --> 21:49.280
have you ever considered your own safety?

21:49.280 --> 21:50.350
Of course I'll consider

21:50.350 --> 21:51.660
my own safety.

21:51.690 --> 21:53.040
Really?

21:53.280 --> 21:54.930
If there really is a storybook,

21:54.930 --> 21:56.210
then I was written

21:56.640 --> 21:58.310
to protect you.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.790
I know everything

21:59.790 --> 22:00.720
you plan to do.

22:01.070 --> 22:01.880
If—

22:01.900 --> 22:03.200
I'm just saying if—

22:03.480 --> 22:05.510
I knew that wound would hurt you so badly,

22:05.510 --> 22:06.830
I definitely
wouldn't have listened to you—

22:06.830 --> 22:09.000
I would have tried my best
to kill Chu Guihong first.

22:09.000 --> 22:09.440
Your Highness,

22:09.440 --> 22:10.440
-Enough.
-you...

22:11.350 --> 22:12.480
I know you're loyal.

22:13.350 --> 22:14.440
Then promise me

22:14.830 --> 22:16.270
you'll include your own safety

22:16.270 --> 22:17.350
in your plans.

22:19.640 --> 22:20.440
Fine.

22:21.650 --> 22:23.110
I still don't believe you.

22:23.160 --> 22:24.510
Unless you tell me

22:24.510 --> 22:25.440
your detailed plan now,

22:25.440 --> 22:26.500
I can't be at ease.

22:26.680 --> 22:28.030
Don't push it too far.

22:29.550 --> 22:30.350
Fine.

22:31.070 --> 22:33.110
From now on, take me with you

22:33.110 --> 22:34.840
when you go to discuss matters.

22:37.240 --> 22:38.100
Your Highness,

22:38.310 --> 22:39.400
remember this:

22:39.400 --> 22:40.830
in the storybook, I was written

22:40.830 --> 22:42.490
to be completely loyal to you.

22:42.550 --> 22:43.830
Unlike that Shangguan He,

22:43.830 --> 22:45.270
who could vanish any moment

22:45.270 --> 22:46.270
and just fly away.

22:46.270 --> 22:47.870
When that happens, who will you turn to?

22:47.870 --> 22:48.920
It'll still be me.

22:51.110 --> 22:51.920
I got it.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.830
Nan Heng.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.230
Nan Heng.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.680
Today, on my way back to my room,

23:22.680 --> 23:23.810
I smelled medicine.

23:26.400 --> 23:29.000
Is your injury still not fully healed?

23:30.270 --> 23:30.750
Come.

23:30.950 --> 23:31.970
Turn around.

23:32.240 --> 23:32.920
Let me see.

23:32.920 --> 23:33.640
No, no, no.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.510
I'm fine now.

23:34.920 --> 23:36.350
I've been fine for a while.

23:36.350 --> 23:38.550
The imperial physician
gave me some prescriptions,

23:38.550 --> 23:39.950
and now I'm out of danger.

23:40.460 --> 23:41.400
Really?

23:41.790 --> 23:42.400
Really.

23:42.440 --> 23:43.240
You're lying.

23:43.350 --> 23:45.250
You always pretend to be fine
when you are not.

23:45.250 --> 23:47.000
I need to see for myself to be sure.

23:47.000 --> 23:47.750
Let me take a look.

23:47.750 --> 23:48.480
I have something to ask you.

23:48.480 --> 23:49.590
Just one quick look.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.350
No, no, wait.

23:50.350 --> 23:51.880
I need to ask you something.

23:52.310 --> 23:54.270
What did you and Lord Qianyu do

23:54.270 --> 23:55.960
at Waning River Crescent today?

23:55.960 --> 23:56.640
And...

23:56.880 --> 23:59.080
why did he adopt Shangguan He as his son?

23:59.160 --> 23:59.750
Nan Heng.

23:59.750 --> 24:00.510
Why did...

24:00.750 --> 24:01.880
Can we please

24:02.170 --> 24:04.140
keep work talk out of private time?

24:07.440 --> 24:08.160
Come on,

24:08.160 --> 24:09.310
don't worry.

24:09.550 --> 24:10.550
Lord Qianyu

24:10.550 --> 24:13.310
is gradually fitting into this world.

24:13.310 --> 24:15.160
Otherwise, how could he have outdone Madam

24:15.160 --> 24:17.820
and helped Shangguan He and Yiting
get engaged?

24:17.960 --> 24:20.130
But he wanted to take you away
this morning.

24:20.130 --> 24:22.640
While we women
are busy handling things outside,

24:22.640 --> 24:23.790
can you men

24:23.810 --> 24:25.500
stop overthinking

24:25.920 --> 24:26.960
at home?

24:26.960 --> 24:27.680
Okay?

24:27.920 --> 24:28.980
Trust me this once.

24:30.580 --> 24:31.310
Okay.

24:36.250 --> 24:37.160
Nan Heng.

24:37.820 --> 24:38.990
Take off your boots.

24:52.480 --> 24:53.590
And your belt too.

25:00.350 --> 25:01.160
Here.

25:05.920 --> 25:06.850
Your outer robe,

25:07.310 --> 25:08.310
take that off too.

25:14.940 --> 25:16.610
You're acting a bit strange today.

25:16.610 --> 25:17.280
Here.

25:24.590 --> 25:25.550
What are you doing?

25:25.550 --> 25:26.110
Nan Heng.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.200
What?

25:35.940 --> 25:36.790
Nan Heng,

25:39.030 --> 25:40.030
I like you.

25:44.620 --> 25:45.880
How much do you like me?

25:49.600 --> 25:50.880
I like you so much that

25:51.270 --> 25:54.430
if you and an ATM
both fell into the river,

25:54.520 --> 25:57.240
I wouldn't hesitate to save you first.

25:58.580 --> 25:59.740
An ATM?

26:02.910 --> 26:05.020
I don't know who that is,

26:05.040 --> 26:05.760
but...

26:06.990 --> 26:09.320
it surely can't beat Xuanjia Army, right?

26:13.490 --> 26:15.150
You fool.

26:17.880 --> 26:18.960
Anyway,

26:19.200 --> 26:20.590
that's a romantic line.

26:21.540 --> 26:22.700
And from now on,

26:23.040 --> 26:24.970
I'll say sweet things to you often.

26:26.350 --> 26:27.430
Before,

26:27.830 --> 26:29.630
you took so many steps toward me.

26:30.350 --> 26:31.240
From now on,

26:33.030 --> 26:34.960
I'll be the one walking toward you.

26:39.350 --> 26:40.950
Love isn't just about words.

26:41.510 --> 26:43.310
You need to show it with actions.

26:46.090 --> 26:46.760
Really?

26:48.390 --> 26:48.980
Yes.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.210
I'm not talking about this.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.550
Didn't you tell me to take action?

26:56.550 --> 26:58.160
So I'm showing you my actions.

26:58.160 --> 26:58.960
Well...

27:14.030 --> 27:14.830
Wait.

27:15.420 --> 27:16.830
You haven't taken off your hairpin yet.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.590
In costume dramas,
no one really minds that.

27:18.590 --> 27:19.720
What if it pricks me?

27:19.790 --> 27:20.790
You must have OCD.

27:20.880 --> 27:23.140
If it pricks you, we'll deal with it then.

27:28.550 --> 27:30.180
Dongting red oranges!

27:30.270 --> 27:31.510
Dongting red oranges!

27:31.510 --> 27:33.910
Juicy and delicious Dongting red oranges!

27:34.440 --> 27:35.290
Take a look.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.660
Dongting red oranges.

27:37.070 --> 27:39.900
Last time we bought some Dongting
red oranges, and then things went wrong.

27:39.900 --> 27:40.650
This time…

27:43.310 --> 27:44.720
You're worrying too much.

27:44.720 --> 27:47.230
Last time, it was because we bought them
to honor my mother.

27:47.230 --> 27:49.350
This time we're buying them
to give to Father.

27:49.350 --> 27:50.270
That's not the same.

27:50.270 --> 27:51.200
It's different.

27:51.640 --> 27:52.440
Here.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.160
Take it.

27:53.400 --> 27:54.260
Your Highness.

27:55.480 --> 27:57.270
Rong Hua? What brings you here?

27:57.750 --> 28:00.610
May I have a word with you
in private, Your Highness?

28:05.550 --> 28:07.350
It's just a engagement,

28:07.720 --> 28:09.250
yet such a grand event.

28:10.440 --> 28:12.470
You really hold my Song family

28:12.640 --> 28:14.680
in high regard.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.310
Song, you're too polite.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.200
In the capital, only our two families

28:18.200 --> 28:20.160
are noble families in the whole drama.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.360
It should be this way.

28:21.770 --> 28:23.540
But Your Highness,

28:23.720 --> 28:25.480
you actually made time to attend

28:25.480 --> 28:27.480
your sister-in-law's engagement.

28:28.640 --> 28:30.240
Some things can't reach a conclusion

28:30.240 --> 28:32.110
without seeing them with your own eyes.

28:32.110 --> 28:33.000
Besides,

28:33.590 --> 28:35.400
your recent actions

28:35.720 --> 28:37.790
have all involved people close to me,

28:38.610 --> 28:39.540
which naturally

28:39.580 --> 28:41.180
made me a little suspicious.

28:43.350 --> 28:44.350
I'm getting old.

28:44.350 --> 28:45.750
What schemes could I have?

28:45.750 --> 28:47.590
I just want to see the younger generation

28:47.590 --> 28:49.550
settle down peacefully.

28:50.480 --> 28:53.210
Guihong wasn't lucky enough
to marry a Song girl,

28:53.550 --> 28:54.590
but He

28:54.830 --> 28:57.490
honored the old friendship
between me and Song.

28:57.610 --> 28:58.720
Indeed.

28:59.550 --> 29:00.550
However...

29:00.960 --> 29:03.640
I consulted
the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

29:04.510 --> 29:06.110
and it seems there's no
suitable wedding date

29:06.110 --> 29:08.000
within the next six months.

29:08.510 --> 29:10.350
So perhaps this matter should...

29:10.350 --> 29:11.550
I think you're trying

29:12.270 --> 29:14.440
to call off the engagement because

29:14.870 --> 29:16.640
Miss Song Yiting refuses to get married.

29:16.640 --> 29:17.510
Chu Guihong,

29:17.820 --> 29:19.500
why are you everywhere?

29:19.680 --> 29:22.280
You even know about
the Song family's affairs.

29:22.910 --> 29:24.770
Yesterday, Guihong was on patrol

29:24.790 --> 29:26.550
and happened to run into Mrs. Song,

29:26.550 --> 29:27.750
so they chatted a bit.

29:30.300 --> 29:31.090
Happened to?

29:32.150 --> 29:34.340
Mrs. Song went to Waning River Crescent,

29:34.340 --> 29:36.940
and you just happened
to take in an adopted son.

29:37.750 --> 29:39.350
Chu Guihong also "happened"

29:39.720 --> 29:42.070
to hear about the Song family's affairs.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.800
What a coincidence.

29:44.270 --> 29:45.440
That's what they say:

29:45.440 --> 29:47.370
"No coincidences, no good story."

29:50.310 --> 29:50.960
Song,

29:51.110 --> 29:52.510
I suddenly need to use the restroom.

29:52.510 --> 29:54.510
Could you wait a moment?

29:54.510 --> 29:55.110
Of course.

29:55.110 --> 29:56.110
This way, please.

30:04.500 --> 30:08.940
[Graceful and Composed]

30:04.990 --> 30:06.400
Shangguan He,

30:06.960 --> 30:09.070
we've already rolled out
the red carpet for you.

30:09.070 --> 30:11.330
Is it really that hard to say
"I like you?"

30:11.400 --> 30:13.350
What exactly are you hesitating about?

30:13.350 --> 30:14.210
Your Highness,

30:14.680 --> 30:15.480
Mrs. Li,

30:15.640 --> 30:17.160
please stay out of this matter, okay?

30:17.160 --> 30:18.400
I'm begging you.

30:18.400 --> 30:19.400
Stop right there.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.310
Come back.

30:22.810 --> 30:24.220
Between Nan Heng and me,

30:24.510 --> 30:26.400
you and Yiting have meddled quite a bit.

30:26.400 --> 30:27.160
So it's only fair

30:27.160 --> 30:28.640
that I return the favor.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.480
Didn't you once tell me

30:31.830 --> 30:33.240
that people like us

30:33.310 --> 30:34.350
have to risk everything

30:34.350 --> 30:36.350
for someone in our lifetime?

30:38.390 --> 30:39.520
You and I

30:39.540 --> 30:41.050
are both lazy souls

30:41.070 --> 30:42.660
with no grand ambitions.

30:43.280 --> 30:46.010
Don't we just want a peaceful, comfortable
life?

30:46.510 --> 30:48.270
But if, in your whole life,

30:48.640 --> 30:50.590
you never meet even one or two people

30:50.590 --> 30:52.320
worth risking everything for,

30:52.510 --> 30:53.970
and you just merely exist,

30:54.480 --> 30:55.920
can you say you've truly lived?

30:55.920 --> 30:56.830
I believed you

30:57.000 --> 30:58.110
and acted on it.

30:58.550 --> 30:59.610
But what about you?

30:59.830 --> 31:02.490
You clearly care
about Yiting more than anyone.

31:02.630 --> 31:04.400
So why do you only say sweet things

31:04.400 --> 31:05.640
behind her back

31:05.640 --> 31:07.700
but stay silent when you're with her?

31:07.830 --> 31:09.240
Chief told me

31:09.590 --> 31:11.380
I don't exist in the storybook.

31:11.830 --> 31:12.960
How could a nonexistent person

31:12.960 --> 31:14.640
give her a happy ending?

31:17.400 --> 31:18.290
The storybook?

31:19.890 --> 31:21.220
So you know everything?

31:22.830 --> 31:23.640
So,

31:24.030 --> 31:25.960
you don't want me to suddenly disappear

31:25.960 --> 31:28.890
and leave your sister
all alone in this world, right?

31:30.350 --> 31:32.280
How could you suddenly disappear?

31:32.750 --> 31:34.640
Things aren't as bad as you think.

31:34.830 --> 31:36.240
Trust me. Really.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.100
Second Master.

31:37.270 --> 31:38.130
Second Master.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.350
bad news.

31:39.510 --> 31:40.510
Something happened.

31:40.510 --> 31:43.640
The enemy showed up at our place.
Go check it out quickly!

31:53.680 --> 31:54.810
Eighteenth Prince,

31:55.510 --> 31:57.440
Why did you specifically invite me

31:57.730 --> 31:59.190
to Waning River Crescent?

32:00.400 --> 32:01.400
This way, please.

32:39.940 --> 32:40.670
Yiting.

32:41.330 --> 32:43.080
You gave him 73 portraits.

32:43.100 --> 32:44.620
I have one more than him.

32:44.750 --> 32:45.880
As long as you agree,

32:46.200 --> 32:47.510
Father's imperial edict for our marriage

32:47.510 --> 32:50.370
will surely come before
the Chu family's proposal.

32:50.570 --> 32:51.700
Eighteenth Prince,

32:51.960 --> 32:54.480
didn't you already ask His Majesty
to cancel the imperial marriage grant?

32:54.480 --> 32:55.740
What are you doing now?

32:57.480 --> 32:58.270
Well,

32:59.030 --> 33:01.110
just consider it a moment of impulse.

33:01.270 --> 33:02.530
Please don't blame me.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.280
Isn't this Shangguan He?

33:10.480 --> 33:11.160
Yiting,

33:11.370 --> 33:12.830
I can accept you don't like me,

33:12.830 --> 33:14.790
but I can't just watch you

33:14.790 --> 33:17.000
marry someone who doesn't care about you.

33:17.000 --> 33:17.810
Yiting,

33:17.960 --> 33:18.880
I like you.

33:19.200 --> 33:21.030
I can write love letters
and poems for you,

33:21.030 --> 33:22.590
confess my feelings in front of

33:22.590 --> 33:23.480
all the noble ladies of the capital,

33:23.480 --> 33:25.660
and ask Father for your hand.

33:25.960 --> 33:28.000
I can do anything you want.

33:28.270 --> 33:29.480
But what about Chu He?

33:29.590 --> 33:30.830
What can he do for you?

33:31.320 --> 33:32.970
So, Eighteenth Prince,

33:33.400 --> 33:35.460
are you here to steal the bride today?

33:37.000 --> 33:37.750
Yes.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.590
I cherish Yiting

33:39.590 --> 33:40.720
and love her deeply.

33:40.880 --> 33:43.960
That's why, before everyone here,

33:44.270 --> 33:45.800
I'm here to steal the bride!

33:47.480 --> 33:48.200
I support the Eighteenth Prince!

33:48.200 --> 33:49.440
Me too!

33:49.790 --> 33:51.650
I support the Eighteenth Prince!

34:04.440 --> 34:05.640
You really scared me.

34:05.720 --> 34:06.590
Your Highness,

34:06.590 --> 34:08.800
you have such a villainous aura!

34:10.110 --> 34:11.770
Those with clear consciences

34:11.800 --> 34:13.320
have nothing to fear.

34:14.360 --> 34:15.699
In broad daylight,

34:16.030 --> 34:17.800
why are you so nervous?

34:18.920 --> 34:19.760
Could there be

34:20.489 --> 34:22.820
other reasons behind

34:23.150 --> 34:24.750
Shangguan He's engagement?

34:30.179 --> 34:32.380
You've started suspecting me already?

34:33.670 --> 34:35.600
Song Yimeng told me

34:35.960 --> 34:37.230
you worked

34:37.800 --> 34:39.150
tirelessly

34:39.150 --> 34:40.230
for this script.

34:41.000 --> 34:43.710
But now, seeing it changed like this,

34:44.670 --> 34:46.000
I'd want to turn the tide

34:46.320 --> 34:48.030
and set the story back on track

34:48.320 --> 34:49.670
if I were you.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.150
Why would I do that?

34:52.760 --> 34:54.070
Of course you would.

34:54.880 --> 34:56.030
I don't believe

34:56.360 --> 34:58.090
you actually want to stay here.

34:59.710 --> 35:01.640
Well, you actually guessed right.

35:03.800 --> 35:04.550
Nan Heng,

35:06.000 --> 35:07.150
after the wedding,

35:07.670 --> 35:08.710
have you

35:08.880 --> 35:10.150
felt unwell?

35:13.110 --> 35:15.710
Is it getting worse
as the Song and Chu families

35:15.980 --> 35:17.180
are getting engaged?

35:21.230 --> 35:22.070
Marry him!

35:22.070 --> 35:22.920
Marry him!

35:22.920 --> 35:23.710
Marry him!

35:23.710 --> 35:24.490
Marry him!

35:24.520 --> 35:25.370
Marry him!

35:25.390 --> 35:26.270
Marry him!

35:26.290 --> 35:27.040
Marry him!

35:27.070 --> 35:27.960
Marry him!

35:27.980 --> 35:28.810
Marry him!

35:28.850 --> 35:29.730
Marry him!

35:29.760 --> 35:30.520
Marry him!

35:30.540 --> 35:31.390
Marry him!

35:31.420 --> 35:32.020
Marry him!

35:32.030 --> 35:33.170
At a time like this,

35:33.200 --> 35:34.330
why are you still staying silent?

35:34.330 --> 35:36.230
Do you really want Yiting to marry him?

35:36.230 --> 35:36.760
I...

35:36.760 --> 35:37.400
Marry him!

35:37.400 --> 35:38.200
Marry him!

35:38.220 --> 35:39.030
Marry him!

35:39.060 --> 35:39.850
Marry him!

35:39.880 --> 35:40.610
Marry him!

35:40.630 --> 35:41.990
I'll count to three.

35:42.400 --> 35:44.230
If no one objects,

35:44.710 --> 35:46.640
I'll take your silence as consent.

35:47.330 --> 35:48.710
Let me tell you, Shangguan He,

35:48.710 --> 35:50.240
you better not regret this.

35:51.590 --> 35:52.110
Three!

35:54.920 --> 35:55.600
Two!

36:02.280 --> 36:02.800
One...

36:02.800 --> 36:03.730
No need to count.

36:04.980 --> 36:05.750
I accept.

36:09.150 --> 36:09.700
What?

36:09.720 --> 36:10.980
You agreed so quickly?

36:10.980 --> 36:12.090
Don't you want to think it over?

36:12.090 --> 36:13.550
I chased you so many times before

36:13.550 --> 36:14.150
and you never accepted.

36:14.150 --> 36:15.070
Why suddenly today...

36:15.070 --> 36:15.550
I didn't want to marry you before,

36:15.550 --> 36:17.210
but now I do. Is that a problem?

36:17.960 --> 36:18.550
Well...

36:18.740 --> 36:20.140
It's not a problem at all.

36:20.150 --> 36:20.840
Yiting,

36:21.070 --> 36:23.590
I'm actually quite happy
to hear you say that.

36:23.590 --> 36:24.710
But you know,

36:24.710 --> 36:25.710
a relationship like ours

36:25.710 --> 36:26.190
sometimes needs to...

36:26.190 --> 36:27.000
Enough.

36:28.920 --> 36:30.230
You men

36:30.880 --> 36:32.470
are all so indecisive.

36:35.050 --> 36:37.000
I'll go to the palace myself
and ask for the decree.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.480
Yiting.

36:54.590 --> 36:55.400
Wait!

37:00.400 --> 37:01.930
Song Yiting, let me ask you,

37:02.920 --> 37:04.850
what kind of love do you truly want?

37:05.550 --> 37:06.810
Love that asks nothing

37:07.190 --> 37:08.390
of the past or future,

37:09.070 --> 37:10.880
understanding each other
and staying together,

37:10.880 --> 37:13.150
and sharing life's journey
to the ends of the earth.

37:13.150 --> 37:14.680
Asks nothing of the future?

37:15.800 --> 37:17.460
What if I suddenly disappear?

37:19.440 --> 37:20.230
Whether you stay or go,

37:20.230 --> 37:21.480
it's your choice.

37:21.960 --> 37:23.490
When have I ever forced you?

37:25.630 --> 37:28.070
What if I leave this world before you do?

37:29.360 --> 37:31.420
Then I'll keep you forever in my heart

37:31.840 --> 37:33.360
and go find the next love,

37:33.600 --> 37:34.860
and the one after that.

37:35.760 --> 37:37.820
There are plenty of men in this world.

37:38.070 --> 37:39.050
I, Song Yiting,

37:39.760 --> 37:41.280
would never waste my youth

37:42.070 --> 37:43.400
mourning over a coffin.

38:05.600 --> 38:07.400
What a heartless Song Yiting.

38:17.220 --> 38:19.070
I don't understand what they're saying,

38:19.070 --> 38:20.800
but I can see what's happening.

38:21.600 --> 38:22.670
Those two

38:23.760 --> 38:24.760
are together now.

38:27.760 --> 38:28.670
Shangguan He,

38:29.030 --> 38:30.090
stop wasting time.

38:30.360 --> 38:31.800
Do you love me or not?

38:44.120 --> 38:44.870
Rong Hua!

39:00.400 --> 39:03.630
♪ Through the night's soft whispers ♪

39:04.730 --> 39:09.160
♪ Parting the mist,
gazing into your eyes ♪

39:13.490 --> 39:16.410
♪ Listen to your memories ♪

39:17.270 --> 39:22.930
♪ Reincarnations are like shadows ♪

39:18.190 --> 39:19.800
Greetings, Your Highness.

39:20.110 --> 39:20.970
Your Highness,

39:21.480 --> 39:22.710
I have some matters to attend to.

39:22.710 --> 39:23.710
I'll take my leave now.

39:23.710 --> 39:24.440
Yiting!

39:24.830 --> 39:29.380
♪ After waking, moving against the flow ♪

39:24.920 --> 39:25.480
Yiting!

39:25.510 --> 39:26.550
Wait, Yiting.

39:27.360 --> 39:27.960
Wait.

39:27.960 --> 39:28.710
Yiting.

39:30.000 --> 39:30.800
Yiting,

39:30.800 --> 39:33.150
is it too late for me to explain now?

39:30.900 --> 39:35.620
♪ Even if the kiss lands between
truth and illusion, I’m still willing ♪

39:33.320 --> 39:33.880
Let go!

39:34.520 --> 39:35.210
Yiting!

39:37.570 --> 39:40.520
♪ Above all sounds,
the moon flows like silver ♪

39:38.510 --> 39:39.320
If—

39:39.590 --> 39:40.920
I mean hypothetically—

39:41.540 --> 39:42.400
if...

39:41.840 --> 39:47.380
♪ The stars fall from the sky ♪

39:42.600 --> 39:44.060
there was no Shangguan He,

39:44.280 --> 39:46.340
or if Shangguan He treated you badly,

39:46.360 --> 39:47.090
would you...

39:49.560 --> 39:53.350
♪ Follow the light
and fall into this maze ♪

39:50.440 --> 39:51.840
consider me?

39:53.070 --> 39:54.000
Enough.

39:54.500 --> 39:55.570
I accept.

39:54.830 --> 39:59.570
♪ In the depths of passing time,
who's still waiting ♪

40:01.210 --> 40:02.870
♪ A single glance back ♪

40:04.730 --> 40:06.010
♪ If the vows are vain ♪

40:07.660 --> 40:09.330
♪ If the journey is too tumultuous ♪

40:10.530 --> 40:15.630
♪ I'll still choose to meet you ♪

40:11.590 --> 40:12.960
Eighteenth Prince,

40:13.800 --> 40:15.110
what are you doing?

40:16.040 --> 40:16.850
Yimeng,

40:17.040 --> 40:17.560
it's...

40:19.630 --> 40:20.320
Actually,

40:20.710 --> 40:22.440
my uncle sent me to help.

40:22.930 --> 40:23.730
Help?

40:26.460 --> 40:27.800
You mean

40:27.960 --> 40:29.150
this is intentional,

40:29.150 --> 40:30.080
a fake proposal?

40:36.610 --> 40:37.290
Nan Heng,

40:38.200 --> 40:41.250
the scripted world has its own rules.

40:41.420 --> 40:43.390
Besides the two you already know,

40:43.480 --> 40:44.540
there are two more.

40:44.840 --> 40:45.630
One

40:45.920 --> 40:47.620
is related to my returning.

40:47.710 --> 40:49.030
As long as you and Song Yimeng

40:49.030 --> 40:51.280
complete the iconic scenes
until the finale,

40:51.280 --> 40:52.600
I can go back.

40:52.710 --> 40:54.150
And the last one is—

40:57.590 --> 40:59.360
changing iconic scenes

40:59.380 --> 41:00.970
comes at a price.

41:02.660 --> 41:08.380
[Changing iconic scenes comes at a price]
